; AdaptiveMultiStrategyEA - index mean-reversion sleeve (entry mode 8, chapters 93, 97, 98, 99 and 100).
; No specific days and no time-of-day habits are used for decisions.
; For an index CFD account (OANDA: a separate sub-account from FX). Symbol names differ by broker/account: check the log line
; "[AMS] 口座にある銘柄" on the first run and edit the list below.
; Signals (long only, published rules, unchanged numbers): R2 / D7 / IBS on the three US indices.
; Sizing and loss control:
;   - position units by number of active rules: 1, 2 and 4 units for one, two and three rules (InpIxRuleWeights, chapter 99);
;     one unit has its own volatility of InpIxRevUnitVol % of equity per year, using a HAR-type forecast of next-day volatility;
;   - the size is multiplied by 0.5 / 1.0 / 1.5 when the VIX is in the lower / middle / upper third of its own history
;     (file AMS_vix.csv in the common folder, refreshed by tools/ci/fetch_vix.ps1; 1.0 when the file is missing or stale);
;   - a stop is re-based every day at 4 x the forecast daily volatility below the price (InpIxSLVolMul=4);
;   - stop-out guard (InpIxSoGuard=0.9, chapter 99): total positions are capped so that even if every stop is hit,
;     the margin level stays above the broker's stop-out level.
; InpIxRevUnitVol decides how much is risked. Tested on the index account with the broker's own minute data,
;   February 2020 - November 2026, which includes the 2020 crash and the 2022 decline (chapter 103).
;   Return per year / maximum drawdown:
;     500,000 JPY:    5 -> +10% / 27%,   6.5 -> +17% / 36%,   8.75 (this file) -> +19% / 48%,   12.5 -> +23% / 55%
;     3,000,000 JPY:  3 -> +10% / 19%,   5 -> +16% / 29%,   6.5 -> +21% / 36%,   8.75 -> +26% / 48%,   12.5 -> +30% / 56%
;   The last 3 years alone looked far better (8.75: drawdown 16-30%). Do not choose the size from that window.
;   This file keeps 8.75 because it is the reference setting of the tests in reports/experiments.md.
; Robustness (chapter 100):
;   - InpIxWarmStart=true: rule states are rebuilt from daily bars at start and after missed days, so a restart or an outage
;     gives the same states as an uninterrupted run;
;   - premise monitor (InpIxRegimeDays=1500, InpIxRegimeThr=1.0, InpIxRegimeRef=US500): the reversion rules rely on index returns
;     reversing from day to day (true since about 1999). The monitor is the rank correlation, over the last 1500 daily bars
;     of US500, between a day's return and the weighted sum of the previous four returns. While it is more than one standard
;     error (1/sqrt(1500) = 0.026) above zero (returns tend to continue), IBS - the rule without the 200-day filter - is
;     switched off for all symbols. Since 1999 it has not triggered, so it costs nothing in the tests; in the 1962-98 data
;     it roughly halved the worst drawdown. It reacts slowly (about two years), so it is insurance against a lasting change,
;     not a timing tool. A false alarm would cut profit by about 40% (and risk by about 30%) while it lasts.
;     With fewer than 1506 daily bars (e.g. in a 3-year Strategy Tester run) it is not evaluated and IBS stays on.
;   - InpIxJointRound=false: lots are floored per symbol. Joint rounding (true) holds positions more often on a small account,
;     but with real ticks it earned less for the same drawdown, so it is left as an option.
; Swap avoidance (InpIxFlatMinutes) is off: its saving was small and the real-tick results were mixed (chapter 99).
; The trend sleeve is off: on index CFDs it adds nothing on top of the reversion sleeve (chapter 96).
; Attach to a chart of any symbol in the account (H1).
InpEntryMode=8
InpIxRevSymbols=US500,US100,US30
InpIxTrendSymbols=none
InpIxRuleR2=true
InpIxRuleD7=true
InpIxRuleIBS=true
InpIxRevUnitVol=8.75
InpIxTrendUnitVol=0.0
InpIxTrendCheckDays=7
InpIxMaxLev=10.0
InpIxBand=0.25
InpIxSLVolMul=4.0
InpIxVolModel=1
InpIxVixFile=AMS_vix.csv
InpIxVixLowMult=0.5
InpIxVixHighMult=1.5
InpIxRuleWeights=1,2,4
InpIxSoGuard=0.9
InpIxFlatMinutes=0
InpIxFlatEdgeBp=0.0
InpIxDelayMin=5
InpIxMaxSpreadPct=0.05
InpMaxMarginUsePct=90.0
InpIxJointRound=false
InpIxJointEps=0.25
InpIxWarmStart=true
InpIxRegimeDays=1500
InpIxRegimeThr=1.0
InpIxRegimeRef=US500
InpIxDryRun=false
InpIxEquityOffset=0
